{
  "id": "otr_sd15_stills",
  "display_name": "SD 1.5 stills -- the one wiring that actually MINTS through the sd15 engine, which is what a per-style pack checkpoint needs in order to be seen. Copy of otr_w45_still_flat with the three image roles moved from z_image_turbo to sd15: still_* lanes consume a still, so the engine really runs (the Mac profile also names sd15, but its viz_* lanes consume none, and its own display_name says so). Pair it with --visual-style anime to see the anime pack's own checkpoint. DRAFT: rendered on a 5080, judged by nobody yet.",
